  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help a Poor HIV+ Orphan to Survive in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support Jane financially and otherwise to continue living without allowing the death of her parents to deter her from achieving her goals in life. Jane is a 15-year-old girl living with HIV, an orphan who lost her father few years back while her mother died as a result of AIDS on February. She&apos;s left with no one to take care of her and her only younger brother. Your donations will surely help to support her feeding, education, clinic appointments etc.</narrative>
  </description>
